DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       ppppmmttoolljj  reads  a  PPM image as input and converts it into a color file
       suitable to be printed by an HP color PCL 5 printer.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In addition to the options common to all programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common  Options  ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩  ), ppppmmttoolljj recognizes the
       following command line options:



       --ddeellttaa Apply delta row compression to reduce the size of the pcl file.

       --ggaammmmaa _i_n_t
              Gamma correct the image using the integer parameter as  a  gamma
              (default 0).


       --ffllooaatt Suppress  positioning  information.  The default is to write the
              sequence ESC&l0E to the output.


       --nnoorreesseett
              Don't write the reset sequence to the beginning and end  of  the
              output.


       --rreessoolluuttiioonn
              Set the required output resolution 75|100|150|300|600




